---
/**
 * Deliberately undesigned. The instrument does not run here: no HUD, no field,
 * no scroll choreography — a legal document should be readable, printable and
 * boring.
 *
 * Every statement below is checked against what the site actually does as of
 * the effective date: the form posts to worker/contact.ts, which relays the
 * message through Resend and mails the visitor a copy; Google Analytics 4 runs
 * on every production page (Base.astro); nothing is written to sessionStorage
 * or localStorage any more. When any of that changes, this page changes with
 * it. It is the page the consent box on the form links to, and for a while it
 * described a mail-draft form that no longer existed.
 */
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { COMPANY } from '../data/content';

const EFFECTIVE = '11 September 2026';
---
<Base
  title="Privacy policy — Guardian Holdings JSC"
  description="What Guardian Holdings JSC collects when you visit and when you write to us, why we process it, how long we keep it, and the rights you have over it."
>
  <article class="legal">
    <p class="readout">Effective {EFFECTIVE}</p>
    <h1 class="h-section">Privacy policy.</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      What we collect when you visit and when you write to us, why we process it,
      how long we keep it, and the rights you have over it.
    </p>

    <h2>Who we are</h2>
    <p>
      {COMPANY.name}, UIC {COMPANY.uic}, {COMPANY.street}, {COMPANY.city}, {COMPANY.country}.
      Write to <a href={`mailto:${COMPANY.email}`}>{COMPANY.email}</a> about anything
      on this page.
    </p>

    <h2>What this policy covers</h2>
    <p>
      This site, guardianholdingsjsc.com. It does not cover any separate agreement
      you sign with us, or any EU licensed investment intermediary that holds a
      separately managed account for you; their own privacy notice governs that
      account.
    </p>

    <h2>What we collect when you write to us</h2>
    <p>
      The name, email address, stated role and message you put into the contact
      form. Pressing Send delivers it to us from this page through Resend, our
      email delivery provider, and a copy of your message is emailed to the
      address you gave, so you have a record of what you sent. Your IP address is
      used to limit repeated submissions and, if a bot check is running on the
      form, to verify it; we do not store it. If the send fails, the form opens a
      draft in your own email client instead, and nothing reaches us until you
      send it yourself.
    </p>

    <h2>What we collect when you visit</h2>
    <p>
      This site runs Google Analytics 4. It sets the <code>_ga</code> and
      <code>_ga_*</code> cookies in your browser and sends the pages you view,
      your approximate location, and your device and browser to Google, which we
      use to see how the site is read. Cloudflare, which serves the site, records
      requests for security and performance under its own privacy policy; we keep
      no server logs of our own. Nothing else is stored on your device: the sound
      control keeps no memory between visits.
    </p>

    <h2>Why we process it, and on what basis</h2>
    <p>
      Your message: to answer it. The basis is your consent, which you give by
      ticking the box on the form (GDPR Art. 6(1)(a)); where your message concerns
      a mandate or an investment, it is also a step taken at your request before a
      contract (Art. 6(1)(b)). You may withdraw consent at any time by writing to
      us, and we then delete the correspondence unless a legal duty requires us to
      keep it.
    </p>
    <p>
      Analytics: our legitimate interest in understanding how the site is used
      (Art. 6(1)(f)). You can prevent it by blocking cookies for this site in your
      browser, or with Google's opt-out browser add-on.
    </p>

    <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
    <p>
      Correspondence: 24 months from the last message in the exchange, then
      deleted, unless it leads to an agreement, in which case it is kept with that
      agreement. Analytics: Google keeps the data for up to 14 months; the
      <code>_ga</code> cookie expires after 2 years unless you delete it sooner.
    </p>

    <h2>Who receives it</h2>
    <p>
      Cloudflare, Inc. (hosting, the contact endpoint, rate limiting and, when it
      is switched on, the Turnstile bot check); Resend, Inc. (delivery of your
      message to us and of the copy to you); Apple Inc. (the iCloud mailbox that
      receives it); Google LLC (analytics). Each processes it on our instructions.
      Nobody else. We do not sell it, and we do not use it for advertising.
    </p>

    <h2>International transfers</h2>
    <p>
      Cloudflare, Resend, Apple and Google are United States companies and may
      process data there. All four are certified under the EU–US Data Privacy
      Framework, which the European Commission recognises as adequate protection.
      Write to us for a copy of the safeguards.
    </p>

    <h2>Your rights</h2>
    <p>
      You may ask for a copy of what we hold, ask us to correct or erase it, object
      to processing, ask us to restrict it, or withdraw your consent. Write to
      <a href={`mailto:${COMPANY.email}`}>{COMPANY.email}</a>. You may also complain to
      the Bulgarian Commission for Personal Data Protection, 2 Prof. Tsvetan Lazarov
      Blvd, Sofia 1592, <a href="https://cpdp.bg" rel="noreferrer">cpdp.bg</a>.
    </p>

    <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
    <p>We date and publish any change on this page. This version took effect on {EFFECTIVE}.</p>

    <p class="legal__back"><a href="/">← Return</a></p>
  </article>
</Base>
<style>
  .legal {
    max-width: 68ch;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: clamp(64px, 10vh, 128px) var(--gutter);
  }
  .legal h1 { margin: 16px 0 20px; }
  .legal h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: clamp(1.125rem, 1.8vw, 1.5rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    margin: 44px 0 12px;
  }
  .legal p { font-size: 0.9375rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink-muted); margin: 0 0 14px; }
  .legal .lede { margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .legal a { color: var(--signal-hi); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline-strong); }
  .legal code { font-size: 0.8125rem; color: var(--ink); }
  .legal__back { margin-top: 56px; }
</style>
